Clinical Course: The presence of this antibody indicates a very slow, subtle irritation of the small bile ducts. It takes decades to cause severe problems and is highly manageable. Your liver is not failing tonight.

SAFETY-NETTING ADVICE

Seek emergency medical care if you experience severe, sharp, unremitting pain in your upper right abdomen that prevents you from taking a deep breath.

